{"seq":2,"slug":"ci-and-release","title":"CI 与发布","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/cli-tool-development/testing-and-publishing/ci-and-release","wordCount":549,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"ci-与发布\">CI 与发布</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>CI 与发布</strong>把&quot;打标签&quot;变成&quot;自动产出多平台发布物&quot;的流水线。典型链路是：推送 Git 标签 → 触发 CI → 矩阵构建多平台二进制 → 生成 Changelog → 创建 GitHub Release。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>环节</th>\n<th>关键机制</th>\n<th>目的</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>触发</td>\n<td><code>on: push: tags: v*</code></td>\n<td>以标签为发布开关</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>矩阵构建</td>\n<td><code>strategy.matrix</code></td>\n<td>一次产出多平台产物</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Changelog</td>\n<td>git-cliff 按提交生成</td>\n<td>免手工整理变更</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>发布自动化</td>\n<td><code>permissions</code>、上传产物</td>\n<td>可复现地创建 Release</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>设计目标是<strong>发布可复现、无需人工干预</strong>：同一标签应总能得到相同的产物集合。本文从 GitHub Actions 工作流讲到矩阵构建与 Changelog。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"github-actions-release-工作流\">GitHub Actions Release 工作流</h2><p><strong>GitHub Actions</strong> 为 CLI 工具的自动化构建和发布提供了完整的 CI/CD 能力。典型的发布流程是：推送 Git 标签 → 触发 CI → 多平台构建 → 创建 GitHub Release。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"name: Release&#10;&#10;on:&#10;  push:&#10;    tags:&#10;      - &#39;v*&#39;&#10;&#10;permissions:&#10;  contents: write&#10;&#10;jobs:&#10;  build:&#10;    name: Build ${{ matrix.target }}&#10;    runs-on: ${{ matrix.os }}&#10;    strategy:&#10;      matrix:&#10;        include:&#10;          - target: x86_64-unknown-linux-musl&#10;            os: ubuntu-latest&#10;            archive: tar.gz&#10;          - target: aarch64-unknown-linux-musl&#10;            os: ubuntu-latest&#10;            archive: tar.gz&#10;          - target: x86_64-apple-darwin&#10;            os: macos-latest&#10;            archive: tar.gz&#10;          - target: aarch64-apple-darwin&#10;            os: macos-latest&#10;            archive: tar.gz&#10;          - target: x86_64-pc-windows-msvc&#10;            os: windows-latest&#10;            archive: zip&#10;&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;&#10;      - uses: dtolnay/rust-toolchain@stable&#10;        with:&#10;          targets: ${{ matrix.target }}&#10;&#10;      - name: Build&#10;        run: cargo build --release --target ${{ matrix.target }}&#10;&#10;      - name: Package (Unix)&#10;        if: matrix.archive == &#39;tar.gz&#39;&#10;        run: |&#10;          cd target/${{ matrix.target }}/release&#10;          tar czf ../../../mytool-${{ matrix.target }}.tar.gz mytool&#10;          cd ../../..&#10;&#10;      - name: Package (Windows)&#10;        if: matrix.archive == &#39;zip&#39;&#10;        run: |&#10;          cd target/${{ matrix.target }}/release&#10;          7z a ../../../mytool-${{ matrix.target }}.zip mytool.exe&#10;          cd ../../..&#10;&#10;      - uses: actions/upload-artifact@v4&#10;        with:&#10;          name: mytool-${{ matrix.target }}&#10;          path: mytool-${{ matrix.target }}.*&#10;&#10;  release:&#10;    needs: build&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;&#10;      - uses: actions/download-artifact@v4&#10;        with:&#10;          merge-multiple: true&#10;&#10;      - name: Create Release&#10;        uses: softprops/action-gh-release@v2&#10;        with:&#10;          files: mytool-*&#10;          generate_release_notes: true\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Release</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\