_notes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[git tag v1.0.0] --&gt; B[push tag]&#10;    B --&gt; C[GitHub Actions 触发]&#10;    C --&gt; D[矩阵构建]&#10;    D --&gt; E[Linux x86_64]&#10;    D --&gt; F[Linux ARM64]&#10;    D --&gt; G[macOS x86_64]&#10;    D --&gt; H[macOS ARM64]&#10;    D --&gt; I[Windows x86_64]&#10;    E --&gt; J[上传 artifact]&#10;    F --&gt; J&#10;    G --&gt; J&#10;    H --&gt; J&#10;    I --&gt; J&#10;    J --&gt; K[创建 GitHub Release]&#10;    K --&gt; L[发布二进制文件]\">graph TD\n    A[git tag v1.0.0] --&gt; B[push tag]\n    B --&gt; C[GitHub Actions 触发]\n    C --&gt; D[矩阵构建]\n    D --&gt; E[Linux x86_64]\n    D --&gt; F[Linux ARM64]\n    D --&gt; G[macOS x86_64]\n    D --&gt; H[macOS ARM64]\n    D --&gt; I[Windows x86_64]\n    E --&gt; J[上传 artifact]\n    F --&gt; J\n    G --&gt; J\n    H --&gt; J\n    I --&gt; J\n    J --&gt; K[创建 GitHub Release]\n    K --&gt; L[发布二进制文件]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"矩阵构建\">矩阵构建</h2><p><strong>矩阵构建</strong>（Matrix Build）同时在多个平台和配置上运行构建任务，确保 CLI 工具在所有目标环境中都能正确工作。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>选项</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>操作系统</td>\n<td>ubuntu, macos, windows</td>\n<td>构建环境</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>目标架构</td>\n<td>x86_64, aarch64</td>\n<td>CPU 架构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>链接方式</td>\n<td>gnu, musl, msvc</td>\n<td>C 库实现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rust 版本</td>\n<td>stable, nightly</td>\n<td>编译器版本</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"fn print_build_matrix() {&#10;    let targets = vec![&#10;        (&quot;Linux x86_64&quot;, &quot;x86_64-unknown-linux-musl&quot;, &quot;ubuntu-latest&quot;),&#10;        (&quot;Linux ARM64&quot;, &quot;aarch64-unknown-linux-musl&quot;, &quot;ubuntu-latest&quot;),&#10;        (&quot;macOS Intel&quot;, &quot;x86_64-apple-darwin&quot;, &quot;macos-latest&quot;),&#10;        (&quot;macOS ARM&quot;, &quot;aarch64-apple-darwin&quot;, &quot;macos-latest&quot;),&#10;        (&quot;Windows&quot;, &quot;x86_64-pc-windows-msvc&quot;, &quot;windows-latest&quot;),&#10;    ];&#10;&#10;    println!(&quot;{:&lt;15} {:&lt;35} {}&quot;, &quot;平台&quot;, &quot;Target Triple&quot;, &quot;Runner&quot;);&#10;    println!(&quot;{}&quot;, &quot;-&quot;.repeat(70));&#10;    for (name, target, runner) in &amp;targets {&#10;        println!(&quot;{:&lt;15} {:&lt;35} {}&quot;, name, target, runner);&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn main() {&#10;    print_build_matrix();&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fn print_build_matrix() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let targets = vec![</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        (\"Linux x86_64\", \"x86_64-unknown-linux-musl\", \"ubuntu-latest\"),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        (\"Linux ARM64\", \"aarch64-unknown-linux-musl\", \"ubuntu-latest\"),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        (\"macOS Intel\", \"x86_64-apple-darwin\", \"macos-latest\"),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        (\"macOS ARM\", \"aarch64-apple-darwin\", \"macos-latest\"),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        (\"Windows\", \"x86_64-pc-windows-msvc\", \"windows-latest\"),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"{:&#x3C;15} {:&#x3C;35} {}\", \"平台\", \"Target Triple\", \"Runner\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"{}\", \"-\".repeat(70));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for (name, target, runner) in &#x26;targets {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        println!(\"{:&#x3C;15} {:&#x3C;35} {}\", name, target, runner);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    print_build_matrix();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> ARM64 Linux 的交叉编译需要额外的工具链。使用 <code>cross</code> 工具或在 CI 中安装 <code>gcc-aarch64-linux-gnu</code> 来处理。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"changelog-自动生成\">Changelog 自动生成</h2><p><strong>Changelog</strong>（变更日志）让用户了解每个版本的变化。<strong>git-cliff</strong> 和 <strong>conventional commits</strong> 是自动化 changelog 的主流方案。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"toml\" data-code=\"# cliff.toml - git-cliff 配置&#10;[changelog]&#10;header = &quot;# 变更日志\\n\\n&quot;&#10;body = &quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;{% for group, commits in commits | group_by(attribute=&quot;group&quot;) %}&#10;### {{ group | upper_first }}&#10;{% for commit in commits %}&#10;- {{ commit.message | upper_first }} ({{ commit.id | truncate(length=7, end=&quot;&quot;) }})&#10;{% endfor %}&#10;{% endfor %}&#10;&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;trim = true&#10;&#10;[git]&#10;conventional_commits = true&#10;commit_parsers = [&#10;    { message = &quot;^feat&quot;, group = &quot;✨ 新功能&quot; },&#10;    { message = &quot;^fix&quot;, group = &quot;🐛 修复&quot; },&#10;    { message = &quot;^perf&quot;, group = &quot;⚡ 性能&quot; },&#10;    { message = &quot;^refactor&quot;, group = &quot;♻️ 重构&quot; },&#10;    { message = &quot;^doc&quot;, group = &quot;📝 文档&quot; },&#10;    { message = &quot;^ci&quot;, group = &quot;👷 CI&quot; },&#10;]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># cliff.toml - git-cliff 配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[changelog]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>header = \"# 变更日志\\n\\n\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>body = \"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{% for group, commits in commits | group_by(attribute=\"group\") %}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>### {{ group | upper_first }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{% for commit in commits %}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- {{ commit.message | upper_first }} ({{ commit.id | truncate(length=7, end=\"\") }})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{% endfor %}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{% endfor %}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>trim = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[git]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>conventional_commits = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>commit_parsers = [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    { message = \"^feat\", group = \"✨ 新功能\" },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    { message = \"^fix\", group = \"🐛 修复\" },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    { message = \"^perf\", group = \"⚡ 性能\" },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    { message = \"^refactor\", group = \"♻️ 重构\" },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    { message = \"^doc\", group = \"📝 文档\" },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    { message = \"^ci\", group = \"👷 CI\" },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>]</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>语言</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>git-cliff</td>\n<td>Rust</td>\n<td>高度可配置，模板驱动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>conventional-changelog</td>\n<td>Node.js</td>\n<td>社区标准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>release-please</td>\n<td>Node.js</td>\n<td>GitHub 自动化 PR</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>changesets</td>\n<td>Node.js</td>\n<td>Monorepo 友好</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"发布流程自动化\">发布流程自动化</h2><p>完整的发布流程应最大限度地自动化，减少人工操作。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"#!/usr/bin/env bash&#10;&#10;VERSION=$1&#10;if [ -z &quot;$VERSION&quot; ]; then&#10;  echo &quot;用法: ./release.sh &lt;version&gt;&quot;&#10;  exit 1&#10;fi&#10;&#10;echo &quot;=== 发布 v$VERSION ===&quot;&#10;&#10;echo &quot;1. 更新版本号...&quot;&#10;sed -i &#39;&#39; &quot;s/^version = \\&quot;.*\\&quot;/version = \\&quot;$VERSION\\&quot;/&quot; Cargo.toml&#10;cargo check&#10;&#10;echo &quot;2. 生成 changelog...&quot;&#10;git-cliff --tag &quot;v$VERSION&quot; -o CHANGELOG.md&#10;&#10;echo &quot;3. 提交变更...&quot;&#10;git add Cargo.toml Cargo.lock CHANGELOG.md&#10;git commit -m &quot;chore: release v$VERSION&quot;&#10;&#10;echo &quot;4. 创建标签...&quot;&#10;git tag -a &quot;v$VERSION&quot; -m &quot;Release v$VERSION&quot;&#10;&#10;echo &quot;5. 推送...&quot;&#10;git push origin main --tags&#10;&#10;echo &quot;=== 完成! CI 将自动构建和发布 ===&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#!/usr/bin/env bash</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">VERSION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">$1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-z</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$VERSION</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ]; </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"用法: ./release.sh &#x3C;version>\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  exit</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">fi</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"=== 发布 v</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$VERSION</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ===\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"1. 更新版本号...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sed</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -i</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ''</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"s/^version = </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/version = </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$VERSION</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> Cargo.toml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cargo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> check</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"2. 生成 changelog...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git-cliff</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --tag</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"v</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$VERSION</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -o</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> CHANGELOG.md</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"3. 提交变更...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> Cargo.toml</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> Cargo.lock</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> CHANGELOG.md</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> commit</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"chore: release v</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$VERSION</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"4. 创建标签...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> tag</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -a</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"v</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$VERSION</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"Release v</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$VERSION</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"5. 推送...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> push</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> origin</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> main</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --tags</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"=== 完成! CI 将自动构建和发布 ===\"</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[更新版本号] --&gt; B[生成 Changelog]&#10;    B --&gt; C[提交 + 标签]&#10;    C --&gt; D[推送到 GitHub]&#10;    D --&gt; E[CI 自动构建]&#10;    E --&gt; F[创建 Release]\">graph LR\n    A[更新版本号] --&gt; B[生成 Changelog]\n    B --&gt; C[提交 + 标签]\n    C --&gt; D[推送到 GitHub]\n    D --&gt; E[CI 自动构建]\n    E --&gt; F[创建 Release]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((CI 与发布))&#10;    GitHub Actions&#10;      tag 触发&#10;      矩阵构建&#10;      Release 创建&#10;    矩阵构建&#10;      多操作系统&#10;      多架构&#10;      artifact 上传&#10;    Changelog&#10;      git-cliff&#10;      conventional commits&#10;      自动生成&#10;    发布流程&#10;      版本号更新&#10;      标签推送&#10;      自动化脚本\">mindmap\n  root((CI 与发布))\n    GitHub Actions\n      tag 触发\n      矩阵构建\n      Release 创建\n    矩阵构建\n      多操作系统\n      多架构\n      artifact 上传\n    Changelog\n      git-cliff\n      conventional commits\n      自动生成\n    发布流程\n      版本号更新\n      标签推送\n      自动化脚本</pre><ul>\n<li>GitHub Actions 的 tag 触发模式是 CLI 工具发布的标准流程</li>\n<li>矩阵构建同时覆盖 Linux、macOS、Windows 三大平台和 x86_64、ARM64 两种架构</li>\n<li>git-cliff 基于 conventional commits 自动生成结构化的 changelog</li>\n<li>发布流程应自动化为脚本，减少人工操作中的遗漏和错误</li>\n<li><code>softprops/action-gh-release</code> 自动创建 GitHub Release 并附加预编译二进制</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"CI 与发布","id":"ci-与发布"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"GitHub Actions Release 工作流","id":"github-actions-release-工作流"},{"level":2,"text":"矩阵构建","id":"矩阵构建"},{"level":2,"text":"Changelog 自动生成","id":"changelog-自动生成"},{"level":2,"text":"发布流程自动化","id":"发布流程自动化"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"CLI 测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/cli-tool-development/testing-and-publishing/cli-testing"},"next":{"title":"包管理器分发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/cli-tool-development/testing-and-publishing/homebrew-and-package-managers"}}